CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ primary variadic class member funptr full arity: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^.*found no match.*$
--
N5008 [temp.variadic]/5: pack expansion of a class template parameter pack in
the type of a data member (the parameter list of a member function-pointer type
int(*)(A...)) must expand to one parameter per element when the primary variadic
class template S<A...> is instantiated.  Fixed in typecheck_compound_declarator
(expand_parameter_packs on a data-member function-pointer pointee, mirroring the
template_mapt::apply pointer-branch handling used on the partial-specialization
path).  Non-vacuous (assertion 2 must FAIL).
